const money=(n:number|null|undefined)=>n==null?'待补数据':new Intl.NumberFormat('zh-CN',{style:'currency',currency:'CNY',minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2}).format(n/100);
const num=(n:number|null|undefined)=>n==null?'—':n.toLocaleString('zh-CN',{maximumFractionDigits:1});
function useScope(){const w=useOperating()!;const s=w.snapshot;const key=`${w.business}/${w.nature}/${s?.id||''}`;const q=new URLSearchParams({businessId:w.business,dataNature:w.nature,snapshotId:s?.id||''});return {w,s,key,q,body:{snapshotId:s?.id,dataNature:w.nature}};}
function announce(){window.dispatchEvent(new Event('neo:results'));}
function useResource<T>(resource:string){
 const {s,key,q}=useScope();const query=q.toString(),hasSnapshot=!!s;
 const [stored,setStored]=useState<{key:string;data:T}|null>(null),[failed,setFailed]=useState<{key:string;error:string}|null>(null);const seq=useRef(0);
 const reload=useCallback(async()=>{const id=++seq.current;if(!hasSnapshot)return;try{const data=await api<T>(`/api/v1/${resource}?${query}`);if(id===seq.current){setStored({key,data});setFailed(null);}}catch(error){if(id===seq.current)setFailed({key,error:(error as Error).message});}},[resource,query,key,hasSnapshot]);
 useEffect(()=>{let disposed=false;queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!disposed)void reload();});const changed=()=>void reload(),invalidate=()=>{seq.current++;};window.addEventListener('neo:results',changed);return()=>{disposed=true;invalidate();window.removeEventListener('neo:results',changed);};},[reload]);
 return {data:stored?.key===key?stored.data:null,error:failed?.key===key?failed.error:'',reload};
}
function ErrorNote({text}:{text:string}){return text?<div className="neo-live-error" role="alert"><p>{investigationError(text)}</p><details><summary>查看技术原因</summary>{text}</details></div>:null;}
export function LiveAgentPanel({mode,onEvidence,compact=false}:{mode:AgentMode;onEvidence:(id:string)=>void;compact?:boolean}){
 const domain=useFrozenDomain();const products=domain?.products??[],channels=domain?.channels??[];const [localReply,setLocalReply]=useState('');const {data:discussionScenarios}=useResource<{items:ScenarioResult[]}>('scenarios');
 const {patrol,resumePatrol}=useAgentInsights();const {s,w,key,q,body}=useScope();const [selected,setSelected]=useState(mode),[input,setInput]=useState(''),[sending,setSending]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState(''),[pending,setPending]=useState(''),[hasNew,setHasNew]=useState(false),[historySession,setHistorySession]=useState('');
 const {data,reload}=useResource<{items:AgentRun[]}>('agent-runs');const [current,setCurrent]=useState<AgentRun|null>(null);const [freshConversation,setFreshConversation]=useState(false);
 const {data:policy}=useResource<{interactiveAllowed:boolean;notice:string|null;disabledAgentRoles?:string[]}>('agent-policy');const configuredDisabled=policy?.disabledAgentRoles?.includes(selected)===true;const chatAllowed=policy?.interactiveAllowed===true&&!configuredDisabled;
 const pendingRequest=useRef<{token:string;question:string;payload:Record<string,unknown>}|null>(null);
 const query=q.toString();const token=`${key}/${selected}`;const epoch=useRef(token);useLayoutEffect(()=>{epoch.current=token;},[token]);const inFlight=useRef<string|null>(null),composing=useRef(false),logRef=useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null),atBottom=useRef(true);
 const allRuns=(data?.items??[]).filter(r=>r.mode===selected&&(!r.purpose||r.purpose==='analysis'||r.purpose==='review'));const [linkedReviewId,setLinkedReviewId]=useState('');
 useEffect(()=>{let disposed=false;const id=new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('reviewRunId')||'';queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!disposed)setLinkedReviewId(id);});return()=>{disposed=true;};},[key]);
 const linkedReview=allRuns.find(r=>r.id===linkedReviewId&&r.purpose==='review');
 const [sharedSession,setSharedSession]=useState<{key:string;id:string}>({key,id:''});
 const session=freshConversation?(current?.sessionId||undefined):(historySession||current?.sessionId||(sharedSession.key===key?sharedSession.id:'')||linkedReview?.sessionId||allRuns[0]?.sessionId);
 const runs=session?allRuns.filter(r=>r.sessionId===session).slice().reverse():[];const active=current??runs.at(-1);const busy=sending||runNeedsRefresh(active);const config=agentPresentation[selected];
 useEffect(()=>{let cancelled=false;queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!cancelled){setCurrent(null);setLocalReply('');setError('');setInput('');setPending('');setSending(false);setHasNew(false);setHistorySession('');setFreshConversation(false);atBottom.current=true;pendingRequest.current=null;}});return()=>{cancelled=true;};},[token]);
 useEffect(()=>{if(!runNeedsRefresh(active))return;let disposed=false;const timer=setInterval(()=>{void api<AgentRun>(`/api/v1/agent-runs/${active!.id}?${query}`).then(r=>{if(disposed||epoch.current!==token)return;setCurrent(r);if(!runNeedsRefresh(r)){void reload();announce();}}).catch(e=>{if(!disposed&&epoch.current===token)setError(e.message);});},1500);return()=>{disposed=true;clearInterval(timer);};},[active,token,query,reload]);
 const send=async(question:string)=>{
  const value=question.trim();if(!s||!chatAllowed||busy||inFlight.current===token||!value||value.length>1000)return;
  const greeting=localConversation(value);if(greeting){setLocalReply(greeting);setInput('');return;}
  if(!domain){setLocalReply('当前资料目录尚未读取，请稍后再问；暂不猜测商品与渠道。');return;}
  const grounded=groundDiscussion(value,{products,skus:domain.skus,channels:domain.channels??[],scenarios:discussionScenarios?.items,period:{start:s.periodStart,end:s.periodEnd},canonical:!!s.operating});
  if(grounded.clarification){setLocalReply(grounded.clarification);return;}setLocalReply('');
  if(!pendingRequest.current||pendingRequest.current.token!==token||pendingRequest.current.question!==value)pendingRequest.current={token,question:value,payload:{...body,mode:selected,question:value,...(Object.keys(grounded.scope).length?{dialogueScope:grounded.scope}:{}),sessionId:session,requestId:crypto.randomUUID()}};
  inFlight.current=token;setSending(true);setPending(value);setInput('');setError('');
  try{const result=await api<AgentRun>(`/api/v1/agent-runs?${q}`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(pendingRequest.current.payload)});if(epoch.current!==token)return;setCurrent(result);setSharedSession({key,id:result.sessionId});setFreshConversation(false);setPending('');pendingRequest.current=null;await reload();}
  catch(e){if(epoch.current===token){setError((e as Error).message);setInput(v=>v||value);}}
  finally{if(inFlight.current===token)inFlight.current=null;if(epoch.current===token)setSending(false);}
 };
 const control=async(action:string)=>{if(!active)return;try{const r=await api<AgentRun>(`/api/v1/agent-runs/${active.id}/${action}?${q}`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:'{}'});if(epoch.current!==token)return;setCurrent(r);void reload();}catch(e){if(epoch.current===token){setError((e as Error).message);try{const r=await api<AgentRun>(`/api/v1/agent-runs/${active.id}?${q}`);if(epoch.current===token)setCurrent(r);}catch{/* Keep the last saved status when reconciliation is unavailable. */}void reload();}}};
 const visible=runs.map(r=>r.id===current?.id?current:r);if(current&&!visible.some(r=>r.id===current.id))visible.push(current);
 const revision=(patrol?.status||'')+visible.map(r=>`${r.id}:${r.status}`).join('|')+pending;
 useEffect(()=>{let cancelled=false;queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!cancelled){if(atBottom.current&&logRef.current){logRef.current.scrollTop=logRef.current.scrollHeight;setHasNew(false);}else if(visible.length||pending)setHasNew(true);}});return()=>{cancelled=true;};},[revision,token,pending,visible.length]);
 const showLatest=()=>{if(logRef.current)logRef.current.scrollTop=logRef.current.scrollHeight;atBottom.current=true;setHasNew(false);};
 const startDiscussion=()=>{if(busy)return;setSharedSession({key,id:''});setFreshConversation(true);setHistorySession('');setCurrent(null);setInput('');setPending('');setError('');setLocalReply('已新开讨论，将重新确认对象与范围。');pendingRequest.current=null;atBottom.current=true;};
 const draftFollowup=(r:AgentRun,kind:'evidence'|'conditions')=>{setFreshConversation(false);setSharedSession({key,id:r.sessionId});setHistorySession(r.sessionId);setCurrent(r);setInput(replyFollowupDraft(kind));setLocalReply('追问已放入输入框，可修改后发送；尚未发起分析。');};
 const reply=(r:AgentRun,f:AgentFinding,speaker:string)=>{
  const ids=f.evidenceIds.filter(id=>Object.values(s?.evidenceIds??{}).includes(id)||id.startsWith(`${s?.id}:view:`));const sources=r.result?.marketEvidence?.filter(e=>f.evidenceIds.includes(e.id))??[];const answerEvidence=r.result?.businessAssessment?replyEvidenceReference(r,f):ids[0];const quality=replyQuality(r,f,{businessId:w.business,dataNature:w.nature,inputId:s?.id??''});const basis=quality.basis;const next=f.nextStep||f.candidates[0];const plan=r.result?.runtimePlan as {answerContract?:{intent?:string}}|undefined;const intent=f.answerIntent||plan?.answerContract?.intent;
  if(!quality.inScope)return <p role="status" key={`${r.id}/${speaker}`}>{quality.notices[0]}</p>;
  return <div className="neo-message from-agent" key={`${r.id}/${speaker}`}><span className="neo-message-avatar"><NeoIcon name="robot" size={22}/></span><div className="neo-message-content"><strong className="neo-speaker">{speaker}</strong><div className="neo-message-body">{quality.notices.map(note=><p className="neo-answer-notice" role="status" key={note}>{note}</p>)}<p><strong>结论：</strong><BusinessText text={conversationalText(businessText(compact&&f.marketWorkbench?f.marketWorkbench.judgment.summary:f.conclusion,products,channels))}/></p>
   {basis.length>0&&<p><strong>依据：</strong>{basis.map((item,index)=><Fragment key={index}>{index>0?'；':''}<BusinessText text={conversationalText(businessText(item,products,channels))}/></Fragment>)} <small className="neo-basis-status">{quality.basisLabel}</small></p>}
   {!compact&&next&&<p><strong>下一步：</strong><BusinessText text={conversationalText(businessText(next,products,channels))}/></p>}{!compact&&f.gaps[0]&&<p><strong>判断限制：</strong><BusinessText text={conversationalText(businessText(f.gaps[0],products,channels))}/></p>}
   {answerEvidence&&<button type="button" className="neo-link-button" onClick={()=>onEvidence(answerEvidence)}><NeoIcon name="evidence" size={17}/>查看证据</button>}
   <details className="neo-reply-details"><summary>判断详情{sources.length?` · ${sources.length}条市场依据`:''}</summary>
    {intent&&<><strong>本轮理解</strong><p><BusinessText text={intent}/></p></>}
    {(compact||f.conclusion.length>180||legacyFinding(f.conclusion))&&<><strong>完整经营说明</strong><p><BusinessText text={f.conclusion} review/></p></>}
    {ids.length>0&&<><strong>{r.result?.businessAssessment?'原始来源汇总 · 绑定指标见本次回答证据':'经营证据'}</strong><div className="neo-live-evidence">{ids.map((id,i)=><button type="button" key={id} onClick={()=>onEvidence(id)}>来源 {i+1}</button>)}</div></>}
    {sources.length>0&&<><strong>市场来源 · 当前观察不证明历史原因</strong>{sources.map((e,i)=><div key={e.id+i}><a href={e.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{e.title||e.url}</a><small>发布：{e.publishedAt||'未确认'} · 检索：{e.retrievedAt.slice(0,10)} · {e.verificationStatus==='source_read'?'已读取原文':'来源未能读取'}</small>{e.excerpt&&<p>{e.excerpt}</p>}{e.limitations.map((x,j)=><small key={j}>{x}</small>)}</div>)}</>}
    {([{title:'其他解释与反证',values:f.alternatives},{title:'仍需确认',values:f.gaps},{title:'候选做法',values:f.candidates}]).filter(x=>x.values.length).map(x=><div key={x.title}><strong>{x.title}</strong><ul>{x.values.map((v,i)=><li key={i}><BusinessText text={v} review/></li>)}</ul></div>)}
    {selected!=='joint'&&r.result&&Object.entries(r.result.specialists).filter(([role])=>role!==selected).map(([role,other])=><div key={role}><strong>联查 · {agentPresentation[role as AgentMode]?.speaker||role}</strong><p><BusinessText text={other.conclusion} review/></p></div>)}
    <AssessmentDetails run={r}/><KnowledgeCandidate businessId={s?.businessId||w.business} nature={w.nature} role={w.member?.role||'reader'} statement={f.conclusion} provenance={{kind:'model_result',runId:r.id,inputId:r.snapshotId,evidenceIds:f.evidenceIds.slice(0,20)}}/>
    <details><summary>追溯原始回答与引用</summary><pre>{JSON.stringify(f,null,2)}</pre></details>
   </details>
   {f.proposedAssumptions&&!quality.canPreview&&<p role="status" className="neo-answer-notice">草案暂不进入推演：{quality.previewNotice}</p>}{f.proposedAssumptions&&quality.canPreview&&<div className="neo-live-proposal neo-chat-draft"><strong>草案预览</strong><p>先核对预算、到货与需求假设，再重新推演。</p><button type="button" className="neo-link-button" onClick={()=>{if(new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('page')==='overview')window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('neo:proposal',{detail:{snapshotId:s?.id,runId:r.id}}));else window.location.assign(w.href(`/demo?page=overview&view=forecast&proposalRunId=${encodeURIComponent(r.id)}`));}}>调整条件，预览方案 <NeoIcon name="arrow" size={16}/></button></div>}
   {r.id===active?.id&&chatAllowed&&<div className="neo-agent-followups" aria-label="继续追问"><button type="button" disabled={busy} onClick={()=>draftFollowup(r,'evidence')}>核对判断依据</button>{next&&<button type="button" disabled={busy} onClick={()=>draftFollowup(r,'conditions')}>核对行动条件</button>}</div>}
  </div></div></div>;
 };
 const sessions=[...new Map(allRuns.map(r=>[r.sessionId,r])).values()];
 const lastMarket=[...visible,...(patrol?[patrol]:[])].flatMap(r=>r.result?.marketEvidence??[]).map(e=>e.retrievedAt).sort().at(-1);
 return <aside className={`neo-agent neo-card neo-live-agent${compact?' neo-agent-compact':''}`} aria-label={config.name} data-agent={selected}>
  <div className="neo-agent-title"><h2>{config.name}</h2><small className="neo-agent-status">{busy||runNeedsRefresh(patrol)?'核查中':chatAllowed?(domain?'可对话':'资料待就绪'):'仅查看'}</small></div>
  {configuredDisabled&&<p role="status" className="neo-local-note">该专业已在后台停用，重新启用并发布配置后可开始新调查。</p>}{policy?.notice&&(compact?<details className="neo-reply-details neo-market-policy"><summary>数据与分析范围</summary><p>{policy.notice}</p></details>:<p role="status" className="neo-local-note">{policy.notice}</p>)}
  {mode==='joint'&&<div className="neo-agent-tabs" role="group" aria-label="协同智能体">{(['joint','conversion','supply','market'] as AgentMode[]).map(m=><button type="button" key={m} aria-pressed={selected===m} className={selected===m?'active':''} onClick={()=>{if(session)setSharedSession({key,id:session});setSelected(m);}}>{({joint:'协同',conversion:'人',supply:'货',market:'场'} as Record<string,string>)[m]}</button>)}</div>}
  <button type="button" className="neo-suggest" disabled={!s||!chatAllowed||!domain||busy} onClick={()=>void send(config.action)}><NeoIcon name={selected==='orchestrator'?'lightning':'bulb'} size={20}/><span>建议行动 · {config.action}</span><NeoIcon name="arrow" size={18}/></button>
  {chatAllowed&&!domain&&<p role="status" className="neo-local-note">资料目录尚未就绪，可先编辑问题；读取完成后可发送。</p>}
  <div className="neo-agent-conversation-tools"><button type="button" disabled={busy} onClick={startDiscussion}>新开讨论</button><small>{freshConversation?'新讨论 · 尚未发送':'每轮重新核对当前资料'}</small></div>
  {sessions.length>1&&<details className="neo-reply-details"><summary>回读历史对话</summary><label className="neo-live-field">本专业会话<select value={session??''} onChange={e=>{setFreshConversation(false);setHistorySession(e.target.value);setCurrent(null);}}>{freshConversation&&<option value="">新讨论 · 尚未发送</option>}{sessions.map(r=><option key={r.sessionId} value={r.sessionId}>{r.createdAt?new Date(r.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'}):''} · {r.purpose==='review'?'当前生意专业审查':technicalQuestion(r.question)?'原始提问（含计算参数）':r.question.slice(0,28)}</option>)}</select></label></details>}
  <div ref={logRef} className="neo-chat-log" role="log" aria-label="经营分析对话" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions text" onScroll={e=>{const el=e.currentTarget;atBottom.current=el.scrollHeight-el.scrollTop-el.clientHeight<40;}}>
   {(!patrol?.result||freshConversation)&&!visible.length&&!pending&&<div className="neo-message from-agent"><span className="neo-message-avatar"><NeoIcon name="robot" size={22}/></span><div className="neo-message-content"><div className="neo-message-body"><p>{s?'可以从本页证据开始核查，也可以补充你的经营判断。':'先选择或导入经营快照，再开始分析。'}</p></div></div></div>}
   {!freshConversation&&patrol?.result&&(selected==='joint'?<>{(['conversion','supply','market'] as AgentMode[]).filter(role=>patrol.result!.specialists[role]).map(role=>reply(patrol,patrol.result!.specialists[role],agentPresentation[role].speaker))}{patrol.status==='completed'&&patrol.result.finding?reply(patrol,patrol.result.finding,'协同判断'):<p className="neo-thinking">专业判断已取得，协同整理尚未完成。</p>}</>:selected==='orchestrator'?(patrol.status==='completed'&&patrol.result.finding?reply(patrol,patrol.result.finding,'行动编排'):<p className="neo-thinking">专业判断已取得，行动编排尚未完成。</p>):patrol.result.specialists[selected]?reply(patrol,patrol.result.specialists[selected],config.speaker):null)}
   {!freshConversation&&patrol&&!patrol.result&&['pending_dispatch','queued','running'].includes(patrol.status)&&<div className="neo-thinking">主动巡检 · {patrol.steps.at(-1)?.message||'正在理解业务与查询数据…'}</div>}
   {visible.map(r=><Fragment key={r.id}>{!(compact&&r.purpose==='review')&&<div className="neo-message from-user"><span className="neo-message-avatar"><NeoIcon name="people" size={22}/></span><div className="neo-message-content"><div className="neo-message-body">{r.purpose==='review'?<p>当前生意审查 · {selected==='conversion'?'4A 客户旅程':selected==='supply'?'供应链与库存':'相关行业信息'}</p>:technicalQuestion(r.question)?<details><summary>原始提问（含计算参数）</summary><p>{r.question}</p></details>:<p>{r.question}</p>}</div></div></div>}
    {r.result?<>{(selected==='joint'||!r.result.finding)&&(['conversion','supply','market'] as AgentMode[]).filter(role=>r.result!.specialists[role]).map(role=>reply(r,r.result!.specialists[role],agentPresentation[role].speaker))}{r.result.finding&&(selected!=='joint'||Object.keys(r.result.specialists).length!==1)&&reply(r,r.result.finding,r.status==='failed'?'已取得的判断':config.speaker)}{r.error&&<ErrorNote text={r.error}/>}{!compact&&<p className="neo-local-note">{runBusinessStatus(r)}</p>}<RunObservationDetails run={r}/></>:!['pending_dispatch','queued','running'].includes(r.status)&&<p className="neo-thinking">{runBusinessStatus(r)}</p>}
   </Fragment>)}
   {pending&&<div className="neo-message from-user"><span className="neo-message-avatar"><NeoIcon name="people" size={22}/></span><div className="neo-message-content"><div className="neo-message-body"><p>{pending}</p><small>{sending?'正在保存问题…':'问题未保存，可重试'}</small></div></div></div>}
   {busy&&<div className="neo-thinking">{active?<AgentProgress run={active}/>:<p role="status">正在保存问题…</p>} {active&&!active.observability?.cancellationPending&&<button type="button" className="neo-text-button" onClick={()=>void control('cancel')}>取消</button>}</div>}
  </div>
  {hasNew&&<button type="button" className="neo-text-button" onClick={showLatest}>有新回复，查看最新消息</button>}
  {canResumeRun(active)&&<button type="button" className="neo-text-button" onClick={()=>void control('resume')}>继续本次分析</button>}
  {active&&!active.result&&<RunObservationDetails run={active}/>}
  {localReply&&<p role="status" className="neo-local-note">{localReply}</p>}<ErrorNote text={error}/>{canResumeRun(patrol)&&<button type="button" className="neo-text-button" onClick={()=>void resumePatrol()}>恢复主动巡检</button>}<div className="neo-prompts">{config.questions.map(x=><button type="button" key={x} disabled={!s||!chatAllowed||!domain||busy} onClick={()=>void send(x)}>{x}</button>)}</div>
  <form className="neo-composer" onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();void send(input);}}><textarea aria-label="输入问题或经营补充" placeholder={config.placeholder} maxLength={1000} disabled={!s||!chatAllowed} value={input} onChange={e=>setInput(e.target.value)} onCompositionStart={()=>{composing.current=true;}} onCompositionEnd={()=>{composing.current=false;}} onKeyDown={e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'&&!e.shiftKey&&!composing.current&&!e.nativeEvent.isComposing){e.preventDefault();void send(input);}}}/><div className="neo-composer-footer"><small>{input.length?`${input.length}/1000 · 补充信息待核实`:'补充经营信息或继续追问'}</small><button type="submit" aria-label="发送消息" disabled={!s||!chatAllowed||!domain||busy||!input.trim()}><NeoIcon name="up" weight="bold" size={25}/></button></div></form>
  {active?.result?.businessAssessment&&<details><summary>当前讨论范围与版本</summary><p>{JSON.stringify(active.result.businessAssessment.scope.metricScope??{})}</p><p>版本 {active.result.businessAssessment.scope.inputId}</p><p>{String((active.result.businessAssessment.context.conversation as {notice?:string})?.notice??'每轮核对冻结资料')}</p></details>}
  <div className="neo-local-note">经营截至 {s?.asOf||'待选择'} · {s?.dataNature==='demo'?'合成经营数据':'经营数据'}{lastMarket?` · 市场检索 ${lastMarket.slice(0,10)}`:''} · 条件确认后推演</div>
 </aside>;
}

export function RunObservationDetails({run}:{run:AgentRun}){
 const o=run.observability??run.result?.runtime;if(!o)return null;
 return <details className="neo-reply-details"><summary>查看分析过程</summary><p>{runBusinessStatus(run)}</p>
  <dl><dt>等待时间</dt><dd>{o.waitSeconds??'未记录'} 秒</dd><dt>累计分析时间</dt><dd>{o.runSeconds??'未记录'} 秒</dd><dt>已报告用量</dt><dd>{o.reportedTokens??'未报告'} tokens</dd><dt>估算或预留用量</dt><dd>{o.estimatedOrReservedTokens??'未记录'} tokens</dd></dl>
  <small>用量不是费用；没有价格表，暂不估算人民币成本。</small>
  {o.queuePosition!=null&&<p>等待顺序：{o.queuePosition}</p>}
  <details><summary>查看技术追溯</summary><pre>{JSON.stringify(o,null,2)}</pre></details>
 </details>;
}

export function ForecastScopeNotes({result}:{result:ForecastResult}){return <div role="status"><p>{coverageNote(result)}</p><p>{backtestNote(result)}</p><p>{comparisonNotice(result)}</p></div>;}

export function ResultMetrics({value,result}:{value:Totals;result?:ForecastResult}){const partial=result?.forecastCoverage?.status==='partial',canonical=result?.snapshotId?.startsWith('generation-'),unit=result?.unit??'件',days=result?.operatingModel?.horizonDays??28;return <div className="neo-live-metrics"><div><small>未来 {days} 天{partial?(canonical?'已估算商品／房型':'已估算商品'):''}{unit==='房晚'?'履约房晚':canonical?'可承接数量':'销量'}</small><strong>{num(value.units)} {unit}</strong></div><div><small>{partial?(canonical?'已估算范围净成交额':'已估算商品净成交额'):'净成交额'}</small><strong>{money(value.netRevenueCents)}</strong></div><div><small>{partial&&canonical?'已估算范围贡献毛利':'贡献毛利'}</small><strong>{money(value.contributionMarginCents)}</strong></div><div><small>投放及额外成本</small><strong>{money(value.spendCents==null?null:value.spendCents+value.extraCostCents)}</strong></div><div><small>期末库存资金</small><strong>{money(value.endingInventoryCostCents)}</strong></div><div><small>{partial?'条件结转库存 / 已估算未承接需求':'期末库存 / 未承接需求'}</small><strong>{num(value.endingUnits)} / {num(value.unmetUnits)} {unit}</strong></div></div>;}

type Domain={products:Array<{id:string;name:string;roleId?:string;role_id?:string}>;skus:Array<{id:string;product_id:string;role_id:string}>;roles:Array<{id:string;name:string}>;arrivals:Array<{id:string;skuId:string;warehouseId:string;date:string;units:number}>};
function LiveSharedPulse({onEvidence}:{onEvidence:(id:string)=>void}){
 const {w,s}=useScope();const {weeks,relativeStageSeries,supplySeries}=useNeoData();const {assessmentRun}=useAgentInsights();const sources=assessmentRun?.result?.marketEvidence??[];
 return <section className="neo-card neo-shared-pulse"><h2>三域经营脉搏 · 共同时间轴</h2><div className="neo-evidence-row"><div className="neo-evidence-label"><span className="neo-icon-circle purple"><NeoIcon name="people"/></span><h3>人 · 4A 转化</h3><p>相对指数 · 原始量分开核查</p><a href={w.href('/demo?page=people')}>查看人页 →</a></div><LineChart title="4A 相对走势" labels={weeks} series={relativeStageSeries} min={0} max={Math.max(160,...relativeStageSeries.flatMap(x=>x.values).filter((x):x is number=>x!=null))*1.1} reference={100} height={135} hideXAxis showValueToggle={false} onPoint={(series,index)=>s&&onEvidence(viewEvidenceId(s.id,"week",s.data.weeks[index].start,series.id))}/></div>
 <div className="neo-evidence-row"><div className="neo-evidence-label"><span className="neo-icon-circle teal"><NeoIcon name="cube"/></span><h3>货 · 三类供给</h3><p>备货目标与历史库存分别核查</p><a href={w.href('/demo?page=goods')}>查看货页 →</a></div><LineChart title="三类供给达标率" note="历史库存或备货目标不足时不绘制达标率；可售与在途见货页。" labels={weeks} series={supplySeries} min={0} max={100} height={125} hideXAxis showValueToggle={false} format={v=>`${v.toFixed(1)}%`}/></div>
 <div className="neo-evidence-row neo-market-pulse"><div className="neo-evidence-label"><span className="neo-icon-circle purple"><NeoIcon name="chart"/></span><h3>场 · 渠道与竞品</h3><p>市场观察与历史时间分开</p><a href={w.href('/demo?page=market')}>查看场页 →</a></div><div className="neo-shared-timeline"><div className="neo-timeline-weeks">{weeks.map(week=><span key={week}>{week}</span>)}</div><p className="neo-local-note">历史经营截至 {s?.asOf}。{sources.length?`另有 ${sources.length} 条当前市场来源，检索于 ${sources.at(-1)?.retrievedAt.slice(0,10)}；不嵌入历史作为原因。`:'当前市场来源尚未取得。'}</p></div></div></section>;
}

export function LiveDecisionWorkspace({view,setView,onEvidence}:{view:'evidence'|'forecast'|'action';setView:(v:'evidence'|'forecast'|'action')=>void;onEvidence:(id:string)=>void}){
 const {assessmentRun:patrol}=useAgentInsights();const domainFacts=useFrozenDomain();const {s,key,q,body}=useScope();const [savedBaseline,setBaseline]=useState<ForecastResult|null>(null),[scenarios,setScenarios]=useState<ScenarioResult[]>([]),[chosen,setChosen]=useState<string>('');
 const baseline=savedBaseline?.businessId===s?.businessId&&savedBaseline?.dataNature===s?.dataNature&&savedBaseline?.snapshotId===s?.id?savedBaseline:null;
 const [error,setError]=useState(''),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[notice,setNotice]=useState(''),[proposal,setProposal]=useState<ScenarioInput|null>(null);
 const [product,setProduct]=useState(''),[budget,setBudget]=useState('1'),[response,setResponse]=useState(''),[conversion,setConversion]=useState('1'),[price,setPrice]=useState('1'),[elasticity,setElasticity]=useState('');
 const [arrival,setArrival]=useState(''),[eta,setEta]=useState(''),[units,setUnits]=useState(''),[extra,setExtra]=useState('0'),[weights,setWeights]=useState<Record<string,string>>({});
 const [transferSku,setTransferSku]=useState(''),[from,setFrom]=useState(''),[to,setTo]=useState(''),[transferQty,setTransferQty]=useState(''),[transferDate,setTransferDate]=useState('');
 const [effectiveStart,setEffectiveStart]=useState(''),[effectiveEnd,setEffectiveEnd]=useState('');
 const [reason,setReason]=useState(''),[title,setTitle]=useState('我的经营方案');const epoch=useRef(key);useLayoutEffect(()=>{epoch.current=key;},[key]);
 const {data:decisionHistory}=useResource<{items:DecisionRecord[]}>('decisions');const {data:domain}=useResource<Domain>('agent-domain');const {data:forecastHistory}=useResource<{items:ForecastResult[]}>('forecasts');const {data:scenarioHistory}=useResource<{items:ScenarioResult[]}>('scenarios');
 useEffect(()=>{let cancelled=false;queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!cancelled){const id=new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('baselineId');setBaseline(v=>id?forecastHistory?.items.find(f=>f.id===id)??null:forecastHistory?.items.find(f=>f.id===v?.id)??forecastHistory?.items[0]??null);if(id&&forecastHistory&&!forecastHistory.items.some(f=>f.id===id))setNotice('链接中的预测版本不属于当前资料范围或已无法读取，请选择可回读的版本。');}});return()=>{cancelled=true;};},[forecastHistory]);useEffect(()=>{let cancelled=false;queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!cancelled){setScenarios(scenarioHistory?.items??[]);}});return()=>{cancelled=true;};},[scenarioHistory]);
 useEffect(()=>{let cancelled=false;queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!cancelled){setChosen('');setProposal(null);setError('');setNotice('');}});return()=>{cancelled=true;};},[key]);
 useEffect(()=>{let cancelled=false;queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!cancelled){const id=new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('scenarioId');if(id&&scenarioHistory&&baseline){if(scenarioHistory.items.some(v=>v.id===id&&scenarioBelongsToBaseline(v,baseline)))setChosen(id);else{setChosen('');setNotice('链接中的方案不属于所选基线与资料版本，暂不展示或合并比较。');}}}});return()=>{cancelled=true;};},[baseline,scenarioHistory]);
 const chooseVersion=(baselineId:string,scenarioId='')=>{setBaseline(forecastHistory?.items.find(v=>v.id===baselineId)??null);setChosen(scenarioId);setProposal(null);const url=new URL(window.location.href);url.searchParams.set('baselineId',baselineId);if(scenarioId)url.searchParams.set('scenarioId',scenarioId);else url.searchParams.delete('scenarioId');window.history.replaceState(window.history.state,'',url);};
 useAgentProposal(s?.businessId??'',s?.dataNature??'',s?.id,setProposal,setNotice,setError,setView);
 const selected=scenarios.find(x=>x.id===chosen&&scenarioBelongsToBaseline(x,baseline))??baseline;const allowedProducts=[...new Set(s?.data.inventory.map(r=>r.product_id).filter((x):x is string=>!!x)||[])];
 const productName=(id:string)=>namedProduct(id,domain?.products??[]);
 const assumption={source:'user_assumption' as const,note:'老板在方案预览中提供的条件；作用关系未经因果验证',confirmed:true};
 const spec=():ScenarioInput=>{
  if(proposal)return proposal;
  const input:ScenarioInput={adjustments:[],arrivals:[],transfers:[],extraCostCents:Math.round(Number(extra)*100),extraCostAssumption:assumption};
  if(!Number.isFinite(Number(extra)))throw Error('额外成本无效');
  const changed=[budget,conversion,price].some(v=>Number(v)!==1);
  if(changed){if(!product)throw Error('请先选择调整的商品');if(Number(budget)!==1&&!response.trim())throw Error('请补充预算响应系数假设');if(Number(price)!==1&&!elasticity.trim())throw Error('请补充价格弹性假设');input.adjustments!.push({productId:product,start:effectiveStart||null,end:effectiveEnd||null,budgetMultiplier:Number(budget),budgetResponse:response===''?null:Number(response),conversionMultiplier:Number(conversion),priceMultiplier:Number(price),priceElasticity:elasticity===''?null:Number(elasticity),assumption});}
  if(Object.values(weights).some(v=>v!==''))for(const id of allowedProducts){const existing=input.adjustments!.find(x=>x.productId===id);const weight=Number(weights[id]);if(weights[id]==null||weights[id]==='')throw Error('货盘分配须填写全部商品权重');if(existing)existing.mixWeight=weight;else input.adjustments!.push({productId:id,start:effectiveStart||null,end:effectiveEnd||null,mixWeight:weight,assumption});}
  if(arrival){const p=domain?.arrivals.find(a=>a.id===arrival);if(!p||!eta||units==='')throw Error('请补充到货日期与数量');input.arrivals!.push({skuId:p.skuId,warehouseId:p.warehouseId,date:eta,units:Number(units),replacesPlanId:p.id,assumption});}
  if(transferSku){if(!from||!to||!transferDate||!transferQty)throw Error('请补齐调拨条件');input.transfers!.push({skuId:transferSku,fromWarehouse:from,toWarehouse:to,date:transferDate,units:Number(transferQty),assumption});}
  return input;
 };
 const post=async<T,>(path:string,value:unknown)=>api<T>(`/api/v1/${path}?${q}`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(value)});
 const calculate=async(kind:'forecasts'|'scenarios',value:Record<string,unknown>)=>{
  if(kind==='scenarios'&&baseline?.ontologyRef){const r=await post<{status:string;result:ScenarioResult;error?:string}>('ontology/functions/scenario/runs',{...value,buildId:baseline.ontologyRef.buildId});if(r.status!=='completed'||!r.result)throw Error(r.error||'原资料版本的方案未计算完成');return r.result;}
  return post<ScenarioResult>(kind,value);
 };
 const create=async(kind:'forecasts'|'scenarios')=>{if(!s||busy||kind==='scenarios'&&!baseline)return;const token=key;setBusy(true);setError('');setNotice('');try{const r=await calculate(kind,{...body,requestId:crypto.randomUUID(),title:kind==='forecasts'?'维持现状':title,...(kind==='scenarios'?{baselineId:baseline?.id,assumptions:spec()}: {})});if(epoch.current!==token)return;if(kind==='forecasts'){setBaseline(r);setChosen('');}else{setScenarios(v=>[r,...v]);setChosen(r.id);}const url=new URL(window.location.href);url.searchParams.set('baselineId',kind==='forecasts'?r.id:baseline!.id);if(kind==='scenarios')url.searchParams.set('scenarioId',r.id);else url.searchParams.delete('scenarioId');window.history.replaceState(window.history.state,'',url);announce();}catch(e){if(epoch.current===token)setError((e as Error).message);}finally{if(epoch.current===token)setBusy(false);}};
 const save=async()=>{if(!baseline||!s||busy)return;const token=key;setBusy(true);setError('');try{let scenario=scenarios.find(v=>v.id===chosen&&scenarioBelongsToBaseline(v,baseline))??null;if(!scenario){scenario=await calculate('scenarios',{...body,requestId:crypto.randomUUID(),baselineId:baseline.id,title:'维持现状',assumptions:{}});if(epoch.current!==token)return;setScenarios(v=>[scenario!,...v]);setChosen(scenario.id);}const input={...body,requestId:crypto.randomUUID(),scenarioId:scenario.id,reason,title:scenario.title||title};if(scenario.ontologyRef){const action={...input,buildId:scenario.ontologyRef.buildId,action:'save_decision'};await post('ontology/actions/preview',action);if(epoch.current!==token)return;const result=await post<{status:string;error?:string}>('ontology/actions/submit',action);if(result.status!=='completed')throw Error(result.error||'经营选择尚未保存');}else await post('decisions',input);if(epoch.current!==token)return;setNotice('经营选择已保存。它是决策记录，不代表行动已执行。');const url=new URL(window.location.href);url.searchParams.set('baselineId',baseline.id);url.searchParams.set('scenarioId',scenario.id);window.history.replaceState(window.history.state,'',url);announce();}catch(e){if(epoch.current===token)setError((e as Error).message);}finally{if(epoch.current===token)setBusy(false);}};
 const resetConditions=()=>{setProposal(null);setProduct('');setBudget('1');setResponse('');setConversion('1');setPrice('1');setElasticity('');setArrival('');setEta('');setUnits('');setExtra('0');setWeights({});setTransferSku('');setFrom('');setTo('');setTransferQty('');setTransferDate('');setEffectiveStart('');setEffectiveEnd('');setNotice('已清空未保存条件；历史方案与经营选择仍可回读。');};
 const activateView=(next:typeof view)=>{setView(next);const url=new URL(window.location.href);url.searchParams.set('view',next);window.history.pushState(window.history.state,'',url);};
 const recommended=recommendScenario(baseline,scenarios);
 return <><div className="neo-decision-toolbar"><div className="neo-workflow" role="tablist" aria-label="协同与决策步骤">{(['evidence','forecast','action'] as const).map((v,i)=><button key={v} role="tab" aria-selected={view===v} className={view===v?'active':''} id={`neo-decision-tab-${v}`} aria-controls="neo-decision-panel" tabIndex={view===v?0:-1} onClick={()=>activateView(v)} onKeyDown={e=>{const tabs=['evidence','forecast','action'] as const;let index=i;if(e.key==='ArrowRight')index=(i+1)%3;else if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')index=(i+2)%3;else if(e.key==='Home')index=0;else if(e.key==='End')index=2;else return;e.preventDefault();activateView(tabs[index]);document.getElementById(`neo-decision-tab-${tabs[index]}`)?.focus();}}><span>{i+1}</span>{({evidence:'经营联动',forecast:'预测推演',action:'行动决策'})[v]}</button>)}</div></div><div className="neo-decision-layout"><div className="neo-decision-main" role="tabpanel" id="neo-decision-panel" aria-labelledby={`neo-decision-tab-${view}`}>
  {!s?<section className="neo-card">请先导入经营数据并生成快照。</section>:<>
  {view==='evidence'?<><LiveSharedPulse onEvidence={onEvidence}/><DecisionSummary/><section className="neo-card"><h2>同一份经营事实</h2><p>{s.periodStart} 至 {s.periodEnd} · 库存截至 {s.asOf}</p><div className="neo-live-metrics"><div><small>A3 行为量</small><strong>{num(s.data.events.A3)} 次</strong></div><div><small>支付订单</small><strong>{num(s.data.financial.paidOrders)} 笔</strong></div><div><small>贡献毛利</small><strong>{money(s.data.financial.contributionMarginCents)}</strong></div></div><p>行为次数与订单笔数分别核查，不作为同批客户转化率。</p><button className="neo-primary" onClick={()=>setView('forecast')}>看未来，比较方案</button></section></>:<>
  <section className="neo-card neo-forecast-card"><div className="neo-live-heading"><h2>{chosen?'所选经营方案':'如果维持现状'}</h2><button className="neo-button" disabled={busy} onClick={()=>void create('forecasts')}>{baseline?'重新生成基线':'计算四周基线'}</button></div>
   {selected?<><ForecastScopeNotes result={selected}/><ResultMetrics value={selected.totals} result={selected}/><LineChart evidenceForecasts={{...(baseline?{baseline:{id:baseline.id,weeks:baseline.weeks}}:{}),...(chosen?{scenario:{id:selected.id,weeks:selected.weeks}}:{})}} showValueToggle={false} format={n=>`${num(n)} 件`} title={`${selected.snapshotId?.startsWith('generation-')?(selected.unit==='房晚'?'已入住与未来预测':'净支付与未来承接'):'历史履约与未来预测'} · ${selected.unit}`} labels={[...(domainFacts?s.data.weeks.map(w=>w.start.slice(5)):[]),...selected.weeks.map(w=>w.start.slice(5))]} series={[{id:'baseline',name:'维持现状',color:'#91a4bb',values:[...(domainFacts?s.data.weeks.map(w=>domainFacts.facts.filter(x=>x.kind==='orders'&&x.fact.entry_type==='paid'&&x.fact.business_date>=w.start&&x.fact.business_date<=w.end).reduce((n,x)=>n+(x.fact.quantity||0),0)):[]),...(baseline?.weeks.map(w=>w.units)??[])]},...(chosen?[{id:'scenario',name:'所选方案',color:'#2678e8',values:[...(domainFacts?s.data.weeks.map(w=>domainFacts.facts.filter(x=>x.kind==='orders'&&x.fact.entry_type==='paid'&&x.fact.business_date>=w.start&&x.fact.business_date<=w.end).reduce((n,x)=>n+(x.fact.quantity||0),0)):[]),...selected.weeks.map(w=>w.units)]}]:[])]} forecastStart={domainFacts?s.data.weeks.length:0} forecastOrigin={s.asOf.slice(5)} min={0} max={Math.max(1,...selected.weeks.map(w=>w.units),...(baseline?.weeks.map(w=>w.units)??[]),...(domainFacts?s.data.weeks.map(w=>domainFacts.facts.filter(x=>x.kind==='orders'&&x.fact.entry_type==='paid'&&x.fact.business_date>=w.start&&x.fact.business_date<=w.end).reduce((n,x)=>n+(x.fact.quantity||0),0)):[]))*1.2} height={220}/><p className="neo-local-note">{selected.dataNature==='demo'?'合成数据方法演示 · ':''}最近四个完整周均值基线。{backtestNote(selected)}</p>{'sensitivity' in selected&&<p>作用假设敏感性：销量 {num((selected as ScenarioResult).sensitivity.totalsRange.units?.[0])}–{num((selected as ScenarioResult).sensitivity.totalsRange.units?.[1])} 件；不是置信区间。</p>}{selected.products&&<details><summary>各商品销量与未承接需求</summary>{selected.products.map(p=><p key={p.productId}>{productName(p.productId)}：{num(p.units)} 件；未承接 {num(p.unmetUnits)} 件</p>)}</details>}<details><summary>数据与模型限制</summary><ul>{selected.limitations.map(x=><li key={x}><BusinessText text={x} review/></li>)}</ul></details></>:<p>基线从已保存事实重新计算；不会读取演示曲线。数据不足时会说明缺口。</p>}
  </section>
  <div className="neo-judgment-strip"><div><h3>经营判断辅助</h3><small>基于已保存研判</small></div><span><NeoIcon name="flag"/>优先核查<b><BusinessText text={patrol?.result?.finding?.organization?.priorities[0]?.title||'待研判'} review/></b></span><span><NeoIcon name="question"/>待确认<b>{patrol?.result?`${(patrol.result.finding?.gaps.length??0)}项`:'待研判'}</b></span></div>
  {view==='forecast'&&<section className="neo-card"><h2>试试不同经营做法</h2><button type="button" className="neo-text-button" onClick={resetConditions}>清空未保存条件</button><p>先调整经营条件，再比较结果。也可以在右侧用自然语言提出方案。</p>
   {proposal?<div className="neo-live-proposal"><h3>本次改变了什么</h3><ScenarioConditions value={proposal}/><button className="neo-text-button" onClick={()=>setProposal(null)}>改用下面的条件编辑</button></div>:<>
   <div className="neo-live-actions">{['维持现状','供给改善','需求侧改善','组合方案'].map(label=><button className="neo-button" key={label} onClick={()=>{setTitle(label);setProposal(null);setBudget('1');setConversion('1');setPrice('1');setWeights({});setExtra('0');setArrival('');setTransferSku('');if(label==='供给改善'||label==='组合方案'){const a=domain?.arrivals.find(x=>s.data.inventory.some(r=>r.sku_id===x.skuId));if(a){setArrival(a.id);setUnits(String(a.units));setEta(a.date);}}setNotice(label==='维持现状'?'所有条件保持基线，可直接计算或保存。':label==='供给改善'?'请调整到货日期、数量和额外成本后计算。':'请填写有依据的需求改善或预算响应假设；组合方案同时核对供给条件。');}}>{label}</button>)}</div>
   <div className="neo-live-form"><label className="neo-live-field">需求与价格调整开始日期<input type="date" value={effectiveStart} onChange={e=>setEffectiveStart(e.target.value)}/></label><label className="neo-live-field">需求与价格调整结束日期<input type="date" value={effectiveEnd} onChange={e=>setEffectiveEnd(e.target.value)}/><small>留空表示覆盖整个28天窗口</small></label></div>
   <label className="neo-live-field">调整商品<select value={product} onChange={e=>setProduct(e.target.value)}><option value="">选择商品</option>{allowedProducts.map(p=><option key={p} value={p}>{productName(p)}</option>)}</select></label>
   <div className="neo-live-form">{([{label:'投放增减（%）',value:budget,set:setBudget,note:'0 表示不变；20 表示增加20%'},{label:'订单需求改变假设（%）',value:conversion,set:setConversion,note:'0 表示不变；不是已验证的客户转化率提升'},{label:'价格增减（%）',value:price,set:setPrice,note:'0 表示不变；-10 表示降价10%'}]).map(f=><label className="neo-live-field" key={f.label}>{f.label}<input type="number" step="any" value={f.value===''?'':Number(((Number(f.value)-1)*100).toPrecision(12))} onChange={e=>f.set(e.target.value===''?'':String(1+Number(e.target.value)/100))}/><small>{f.note}</small></label>)}<label className="neo-live-field">额外成本（元）<input type="number" step="any" value={extra} onChange={e=>setExtra(e.target.value)}/><small>运费、调拨或其他方案成本</small></label></div>
   <details><summary>销量响应假设与原始计算参数</summary><p>调整预算或价格时，需要明确需求如何响应。系数只是作用假设，确认输入不等于效果已经验证。</p><div className="neo-live-form">{[{label:'预算响应系数',value:response,set:setResponse,note:'例如0.5：投放增加1%时，需求约增加0.5%，尚需验证'},{label:'价格弹性',value:elasticity,set:setElasticity,note:'例如-0.5：提价1%时，需求约减少0.5%，尚需验证'}].map(f=><label className="neo-live-field" key={f.label}>{f.label}<input type="number" step="any" value={f.value} onChange={e=>f.set(e.target.value)}/><small>{f.note}</small></label>)}</div></details>
   <details><summary>到货与供给调整</summary><label className="neo-live-field">到货计划<select value={arrival} onChange={e=>{setArrival(e.target.value);const a=domain?.arrivals.find(x=>x.id===e.target.value);setEta(a?.date??'');setUnits(a?String(a.units):'');}}><option value="">保持原计划</option>{domain?.arrivals.filter(a=>s.data.inventory.some(r=>r.sku_id===a.skuId)).map(a=><option key={a.id} value={a.id}>{a.skuId} · {a.date} · {a.units}件</option>)}</select></label>{arrival&&<div className="neo-live-form"><label className="neo-live-field">调整到货日期<input type="date" value={eta} onChange={e=>setEta(e.target.value)}/></label><label className="neo-live-field">到货数量<input type="number" value={units} onChange={e=>setUnits(e.target.value)}/></label></div>}</details>
   <details><summary>跨仓调拨</summary><div className="neo-live-form"><label className="neo-live-field">调拨商品规格<select value={transferSku} onChange={e=>setTransferSku(e.target.value)}><option value="">不调整</option>{[...new Set(s.data.inventory.map(r=>r.sku_id!))].map(id=><option key={id}>{id}</option>)}</select></label>{[{label:'来源仓',value:from,set:setFrom},{label:'目的仓',value:to,set:setTo},{label:'调拨数量',value:transferQty,set:setTransferQty},{label:'调拨日期',value:transferDate,set:setTransferDate}].map(f=><label key={f.label} className="neo-live-field">{f.label}<input type={f.label==='调拨日期'?'date':f.label==='调拨数量'?'number':'text'} value={f.value} onChange={e=>f.set(e.target.value)}/></label>)}</div></details>
   <details><summary>主推商品与货盘分配</summary><p>使用已有商品分配需求，全部权重之和为1；调整角色本身不产生额外需求。</p><div className="neo-live-form">{allowedProducts.map(id=><label className="neo-live-field" key={id}>{productName(id)} 权重<input type="number" step=".1" min="0" max="1" value={weights[id]??''} onChange={e=>setWeights(v=>({...v,[id]:e.target.value}))}/></label>)}</div></details></>}
   <label className="neo-live-field">方案名称<input value={title} onChange={e=>setTitle(e.target.value)} maxLength={100}/></label><div className="neo-live-actions"><button className="neo-primary" disabled={busy||!baseline} onClick={()=>void create('scenarios')}>确认条件，重新推演</button><small>每次保存新版本，不覆盖旧方案</small></div>
  </section>}
  <section className="neo-card"><h2>同一基线比较方案</h2><label className="neo-live-field">回看预测版本<select value={baseline?.id||''} onChange={e=>chooseVersion(e.target.value)}>{(forecastHistory?.items??[]).map((f,i)=><option key={f.id} value={f.id}>{f.title?.replace(/^Ontology\s*/, '业务资料版本 · ')||'维持现状'} · {f.createdAt?new Date(f.createdAt).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'}):'保存时间待确认'} · {i===0?'最新版本':'历史版本'}</option>)}</select></label><p>仅比较同一经营范围、同一资料版本和同一基线下的方案。切换版本不会改写原记录。</p>{recommended?<p>条件性推荐：在已输入假设下，「{recommended.title?.replace(/^Ontology\s*/, '业务资料版本 · ')||'维持现状'}」贡献毛利最高；毛利相同时依次比较未承接需求与库存占用。模型与用户假设仍需验证，不代表真实收益。</p>:<p>先排除无法计算或违反供给约束的方案。部分商品尚未估算、成本缺失或计算资料待核时，暂不按全范围毛利推荐。</p>}<div className="neo-live-scenarios">{baseline&&<button className={!chosen?'chosen':''} onClick={()=>chooseVersion(baseline!.id)}><strong>维持现状</strong><span>{num(baseline.totals.units)} 件</span><small>贡献毛利 {money(baseline.totals.contributionMarginCents)}</small></button>}{scenarios.filter(v=>scenarioBelongsToBaseline(v,baseline)).map((v,i)=><button className={chosen===v.id?'chosen':''} key={v.id} onClick={()=>chooseVersion(baseline!.id,v.id)}><strong>{v.title||`方案 ${i+1}`}</strong><span>{num(v.totals.units)} 件</span><small>贡献毛利 {money(v.totals.contributionMarginCents)}</small><small>较基线 {money(v.delta.contributionMarginCents)}</small><small>库存占用 {money(v.totals.endingInventoryCostCents)}</small></button>)}</div>{!scenarios.some(v=>scenarioBelongsToBaseline(v,baseline))&&<p>这个预测版本尚无其他方案，可切换历史版本查看以前的比较。</p>}{selected&&'assumptions' in selected&&<details><summary>查看所选方案成立条件</summary><ScenarioConditions value={(selected as ScenarioResult).assumptions}/></details>}{(decisionHistory?.items??[]).filter(d=>d.selectedScenario&&scenarioBelongsToBaseline(d.selectedScenario,baseline)).map(d=><details key={d.id}><summary>老板已保存：{d.title}</summary><p><BusinessText text={d.reason}/></p><button type="button" className="neo-text-button" onClick={()=>chooseVersion(baseline!.id,d.scenarioId)}>回看这次选择的方案</button></details>)}</section>
  {view==='action'&&<section className="neo-card neo-draft-card"><h2>保存老板的经营选择</h2><div className="neo-action-lifecycle" aria-label="经营决策阶段"><span>调整条件</span><span>重新推演</span><span>保存决策</span></div><div className="neo-action-context"><span className="neo-icon-circle"><NeoIcon name="evidence" size={28}/></span><div><h3>{selected?.title||'维持现状'}</h3><p><BusinessText text={patrol?.result?.finding?.organization?.priorities[0]?.reason||'核对方案条件与取舍，再留下经营选择。'} review/></p></div></div><dl className="neo-draft-details"><dt>确认人</dt><dd>老板 · 保存经营选择</dd><dt>观察指标</dt><dd>商品销量、贡献毛利、未承接需求与库存占用</dd><dt>成立条件</dt><dd>{chosen?'按所选方案的假设进行验证':'维持当前供给、价格和预算条件'}</dd></dl><div className="neo-check-list">{([{label:'核查库存与在途时间',id:s.evidenceIds.inventoryCostCents,icon:'cube'},{label:'核查行为与支付订单',id:s.evidenceIds.operatingPulse,icon:'people'},{label:'核查渠道经营与费用',id:s.data.channels[0]?.evidenceId,icon:'market'}] as const).map(x=><button type="button" key={x.label} disabled={!x.id} onClick={()=>onEvidence(x.id!)}><NeoIcon name={x.icon}/><span>{x.label}</span><NeoIcon name="next" size={18}/></button>)}</div>{selected&&'assumptions' in selected&&<ScenarioConditions value={(selected as ScenarioResult).assumptions}/>}<label className="neo-live-field">选择理由与待确认条件<textarea value={reason} onChange={e=>setReason(e.target.value)} placeholder="例如：先保供；价格响应还需要真实订单验证"/></label><div className="neo-live-actions"><button className="neo-button" onClick={()=>setView('forecast')}>调整条件</button><button className="neo-primary" disabled={busy||!baseline||!reason.trim()} onClick={()=>void save()}>保存决策</button></div><p className="neo-local-note">保存的是经营选择与依据，不会下单、投放或派发任务。</p></section>}
  {view==='forecast'&&<button className="neo-primary" onClick={()=>setView('action')}>比较取舍，保存选择</button>}
  </>}
  <ErrorNote text={error}/>{notice&&<p role="status" className="neo-live-notice">{notice}</p>}{busy&&<p aria-live="polite">正在按所选条件计算…</p>}
  </>}
 </div><LiveAgentPanel key={key+view} mode={view==='evidence'?'joint':'orchestrator'} onEvidence={onEvidence}/></div></>;
}
type Report={organization:AgentRun|null;organizationStale:boolean;recordPeriodStart:string;asOf:string;findings:AgentRun[];scenarios:ScenarioResult[];decisions:DecisionRecord[];limitations:string[]};
function useOrganization(purpose:'briefing'|'weekly'){
 const pendingRequest=useRef<Record<string,unknown>|null>(null);
 const {s,key,q,body}=useScope();const query=q.toString();const {data,error:readError,reload}=useResource<Report>(purpose==='weekly'?'reports/weekly':'briefings/today');const [current,setCurrent]=useState<AgentRun|null>(null),[sending,setSending]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState('');const epoch=useRef(key);useLayoutEffect(()=>{epoch.current=key;},[key]);const active=current??data?.organization;const busy=sending||runNeedsRefresh(active);
 useEffect(()=>{let cancelled=false;queueMicrotask(()=>{if(!cancelled){setCurrent(null);setError('');setSending(false);pendingRequest.current=null;}});return()=>{cancelled=true;};},[key]);
 useEffect(()=>{if(!runNeedsRefresh(active))return;let disposed=false;const timer=setInterval(()=>{void api<AgentRun>(`/api/v1/agent-runs/${active!.id}?${query}`).then(r=>{if(disposed||epoch.current!==key)return;setCurrent(r);if(!runNeedsRefresh(r)){void reload();announce();}}).catch(e=>{if(!disposed&&epoch.current===key)setError(e.message);});},2000);return()=>{disposed=true;clearInterval(timer);};},[active,key,query,reload]);
 const generate=async()=>{if(!s||busy)return;pendingRequest.current??={...body,mode:'orchestrator',purpose,requestId:crypto.randomUUID(),question:purpose==='weekly'?'整理本周经营决策周报：归纳共同议题和分歧、解释已计算方案的取舍、整理老板保存的选择与待核假设。':'整理今日经营简报：指出最值得核查的问题、证据和下一步，联系已保存方案和选择；不要把模拟值写成实际收益。'};setSending(true);setError('');try{const r=await api<AgentRun>(`/api/v1/agent-runs?${q}`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(pendingRequest.current)});if(epoch.current!==key)return;setCurrent(r);pendingRequest.current=null;await reload();}catch(e){if(epoch.current===key)setError((e as Error).message);}finally{if(epoch.current===key)setSending(false);}};
 return {data,run:active,organization:active?.result?.finding?.organization,busy,error:error||readError||active?.error||'',generate};
}
export function DecisionSummary({compact=false}:{compact?:boolean}){
 const {s,w}=useScope();const {patrol,assessmentRun,error:patrolError}=useAgentInsights();const {run,busy,error,generate}=useOrganization('briefing');
 const history=[run,patrol].filter((r,i,rows)=>r?.result&&r.id!==assessmentRun?.id&&rows.findIndex(x=>x?.id===r.id)===i);
 return <section className={compact?'neo-live-summary':'neo-card neo-live-summary'}><div className="neo-live-heading"><h2>{compact?'今日重点':'主动经营巡检'}</h2><button type="button" className="neo-text-button" disabled={!s||busy} onClick={()=>void generate()}>{busy?'正在组织判断…':'整理今日简报'}</button></div>
  <CurrentAssessmentSummary/>{!assessmentRun&&<p>{s?'当前资料尚未形成完整、有效的经营判断。':'请先导入数据并选择经营快照。'}</p>}
  {history.map(r=><HistoricalAssessment key={r!.id} run={r!}/>)}
  <ErrorNote text={error||patrolError||patrol?.error||''}/>{!compact&&<a className="neo-inline-link" href={w.href('/demo?page=overview&view=evidence')}>查看联动证据与方案 →</a>}
 </section>;
}

export function DecisionReport(){
 const {s,w}=useScope();const {assessmentRun}=useAgentInsights();const {data,run,busy,error,generate}=useOrganization('weekly');const decisions=data?.decisions??[];const fallback=run?.result?.finding;const organization=assessmentRun?.result?.businessAssessment?.projections.finding?.organization;
 return <div className="neo-weekly-page"><div className="neo-weekly-heading"><div><span className="neo-overline">老板工作台 / 经营决策</span><h1>本周经营决策</h1><p>从经营议题、方案比较到老板选择，查看依据和下一步。</p></div><button type="button" className="neo-button" disabled={!s||busy} onClick={()=>void generate()}>{busy?'行动编排正在整理…':'生成经营周报'}</button></div><ErrorNote text={error}/>
  <div className="neo-weekly-grid"><section className="neo-card neo-weekly-main"><div className="neo-weekly-section-head"><span className="neo-weekly-icon"><NeoIcon name="lightning" size={22}/></span><div><span className="neo-overline">本周重点议题</span><h2><BusinessText text={organization?.headline||'本周议题待整理'} review/></h2></div></div><p><BusinessText text={organization?.summary||'行动编排会综合三个专业的判断、已比较的方案与老板选择。'} review/></p><div className="neo-weekly-facts"><span>已比较方案 <b>{data?.scenarios.length??0} 项</b></span><span>已保存选择 <b>{decisions.length} 项</b></span><span>经营截至 <b>{s?.asOf||'待导入'}</b></span></div><a href={w.href('/demo?page=overview&view=evidence')} className="neo-inline-link">查看联动证据 <NeoIcon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></section>
  <section className="neo-card neo-weekly-status"><span className="neo-overline">决策进度</span><strong>{decisions.length?`${decisions.length} 项选择已保存`:'经营选择待确认'}</strong><p>{busy?'正在梳理共同议题、方案取舍与待验证条件。':data?.organizationStale?'有新的经营记录，请重新整理周报。':'已保存选择与实际执行分别记录；本页不生成执行状态或收益。'}</p><span className="neo-weekly-state">{data?.recordPeriodStart?new Date(data.recordPeriodStart).toLocaleDateString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'}):'本周'} 起 · 上海时间</span></section></div>
  {organization?.priorities.length? <section className="neo-card neo-brief"><h2>核查顺序与成立条件</h2><div className="neo-brief-grid">{organization.priorities.map((p,i)=><div key={i}><NeoIcon name={i===0?'evidence':i===1?'question':'bulb'}/><h3>{p.urgency} · <BusinessText text={p.title} review/></h3><p><BusinessText text={p.reason} review/></p></div>)}</div></section>:null}
  {organization?.comparisons.length?<section className="neo-card"><h2>已比较方案 · 取舍依据</h2>{organization.comparisons.map((c,i)=><div key={i}><h3>{data?.scenarios.find(s=>s.id===c.scenarioId)?.title||(c.scenarioId.startsWith('forecast-')?'维持现状':'已保存方案')}</h3><p><BusinessText text={c.assessment} review/></p><a className="neo-inline-link" href={w.href(`/demo?page=overview&view=forecast&baselineId=${encodeURIComponent(data?.scenarios.find(s=>s.id===c.scenarioId)?.parentId||c.scenarioId)}&scenarioId=${encodeURIComponent(c.scenarioId)}`)}>回看计算与条件 →</a></div>)}</section>:null}
  {decisions.length?decisions.map(d=>{const note=organization?.savedChoices.find(x=>x.decisionId===d.id);return <section className="neo-card neo-weekly-action" key={d.id}><div className="neo-weekly-section-head"><span className="neo-weekly-icon"><NeoIcon name="evidence" size={22}/></span><div><span className="neo-overline">本周经营选择</span><h2>{d.title}</h2></div><span className="neo-weekly-state">已保存</span></div><div className="neo-weekly-action-details"><div><span>选择依据</span><b><BusinessText text={note?.rationale||d.reason} review={!!note}/></b></div><div><span>待验证条件</span><b><BusinessText text={note?.nextVerification||'经营结果与作用假设仍需验证'} review/></b></div><div><span>保存时间</span><b>{new Date(d.createdAt).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'})}</b></div></div><details><summary>方案计算与老板原始理由</summary><p><BusinessText text={d.reason}/></p>{d.selectedScenario?<><ForecastScopeNotes result={d.selectedScenario}/><ResultMetrics value={d.selectedScenario.totals} result={d.selectedScenario}/></>:<p role="status">{d.resultNotice||'关联方案暂时无法读取，选择理由仍可查看。'}</p>}</details><div className="neo-weekly-action-footer"><p>推演结果是条件值，保存选择不代表行动已经发生。</p>{d.selectedScenario?<a href={w.href(`/demo?page=overview&view=action&baselineId=${encodeURIComponent(d.selectedScenario.parentId)}&scenarioId=${encodeURIComponent(d.scenarioId)}`)} className="neo-primary">回看选择与方案 <NeoIcon name="arrow" size={18}/></a>:<span>原方案暂不可回看，理由已保留</span>}</div></section>;}):<section className="neo-card neo-weekly-action"><h2>本周经营选择</h2><p>尚未保存选择。先比较方案与成立条件，再留下决策依据。</p><a className="neo-primary" href={w.href('/demo?page=overview&view=forecast')}>比较经营方案</a></section>}
  {organization?.nextChecks.length?<section className="neo-card"><h2>下一步核查</h2><ul>{organization.nextChecks.map((x,i)=><li key={i}><BusinessText text={x} review/></li>)}</ul></section>:null}
  {fallback&&run&&run.id!==assessmentRun?.id&&<HistoricalAssessment run={run}/>}
  <p className="neo-weekly-disclaimer">本周指本周保存的经营决策记录；经营快照截至 {s?.asOf||'待导入'}。市场资料按各自检索时间解释。</p>
 </div>;
}

export function LiveForecastPreview({compact=false}:{compact?:boolean}){
 const {w,s}=useScope();const domain=useFrozenDomain();const {data,error}=useResource<{items:ForecastResult[]}>('forecasts');const f=data?.items[0];
 const history=s?.operating?s.data.weeks.map(w=>w.fulfilledUnits??null):domain&&s?s.data.weeks.map(week=>domain.facts.filter(x=>x.kind==='orders'&&x.fact.entry_type==='paid'&&x.fact.business_date>=week.start&&x.fact.business_date<=week.end).reduce((sum,x)=>sum+(x.fact.quantity||0),0)):[];
 const values=[...history,...(f?.weeks.map(week=>week.units)??[])];
 return <section className={compact?'neo-decision-future':'neo-card neo-teaser'}><div><span className="neo-decision-kicker">如果维持现状</span><h3>未来 {s?.operating?.horizonDays??28} 天{f?.snapshotId?.startsWith('generation-')?(f.unit==='房晚'?'预计履约房晚':'商品可承接量'):`${f?.forecastCoverage?.status==='partial'?'已估算商品':'商品'}销量`}</h3><strong>{f?`${num(f.totals.units)} ${f.unit}`:'尚未计算'}</strong><p>{f?`净成交额 ${money(f.totals.netRevenueCents)} · 贡献毛利 ${money(f.totals.contributionMarginCents)}`:'从当前固定快照计算，再比较经营方案。'}</p>{f&&<ForecastScopeNotes result={f}/>}<small>合成数据只验证方法，情景值不是实际收益。</small><ErrorNote text={error}/><a className="neo-inline-link" href={w.href('/demo?page=overview&view=forecast')}>比较预测与方案 →</a></div>{!compact&&f&&s&&<LineChart evidenceForecasts={{baseline:{id:f.id,weeks:f.weeks}}} title={`${f.snapshotId?.startsWith('generation-')?(f.unit==='房晚'?'已入住与未来预测':'净支付与未来承接'):'历史履约与未来预测'} · ${f.unit}`} labels={[...(history.length?s.data.weeks.map(week=>week.start.slice(5)):[]),...f.weeks.map(week=>week.start.slice(5))]} series={[{id:'baseline',name:'维持现状',color:'#2678e8',values}]} min={0} max={Math.max(1,...values.filter((x):x is number=>x!=null))*1.2} height={170} showValueToggle={false} forecastStart={history.length} forecastOrigin={s.asOf.slice(5)} format={value=>`${num(value)} ${f.unit}`}/>}</section>;
}
export function LiveSupplyDetails(){const {s}=useScope();const {data}=useResource<Domain>('agent-domain');if(!data)return null;return <section className="neo-card"><h2>商品角色与到货计划</h2><div className="neo-live-form">{data.products.filter(p=>s?.data.inventory.some(r=>r.product_id===p.id)).map(p=><div key={p.id}><strong>{p.name}</strong><p>{data.roles.find(r=>r.id===(p.roleId||p.role_id))?.name||'角色待确认'}</p></div>)}</div><details><summary>查看按商品规格记录的在途计划</summary>{data.arrivals.filter(a=>s?.data.inventory.some(r=>r.sku_id===a.skuId)).map(a=><p key={a.id}>{a.skuId} · {a.warehouseId} · {a.date} 到货 {a.units} 件</p>)}{!data.arrivals.length&&<p>尚无可回读到货计划。</p>}</details><small>到货前不计为可售；已保存快照中的领域资料保持固定。</small></section>;}
export function LiveMarketSources(){const {data}=useResource<{items:AgentRun[]}>('agent-runs');const sources=[...new Map((data?.items??[]).flatMap(r=>r.result?.marketEvidence??[]).map(e=>[e.url,e])).values()];return <section className="neo-card"><h2>已保存的当前市场观察</h2>{sources.length?sources.map(e=><article key={e.id}><a href={e.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{e.title||e.url}</a><p>{e.verificationStatus==='source_read'?conversationalText(e.excerpt||'已读取原文，摘要待整理。'):'来源未能读取，暂不能形成判断。'}</p>{e.excerpt&&<details><summary>展开原文摘要与限制</summary><p>{e.excerpt}</p>{e.limitations.map((note,i)=><p key={i}>{note}</p>)}</details>}<small>发布日期 {e.publishedAt||'未核实'} · 抓取 {e.retrievedAt} · {e.verificationStatus==='source_read'?'已读取原文':'未核验'}</small></article>):<p>还没有本快照的市场检索记录。向市场观察智能体提问后，原始来源会保存在这里。</p>}<p className="neo-local-note">当前市场与历史模拟经营分开；外部信息进入方案时属于待确认假设。</p></section>;}
